      "text": "A job well done by the crew of USCGC Margaret Norvell WPC-1105, who recently transferred 20 illegal aliens to Bahamian authorities as part of an ongoing mission to protect lives at sea and secure our borders.\n\nThe Coast Guard, along with our @DHSgov Operation Vigilant Sentry partners, maintains a continued presence by air, land, and sea, representing a multi-layered approach designed to strengthen national security, support the rule of law, and uphold U.S. sovereignty. #USCG #maritimesecurity  #BorderSecurity \n\n@USCGSoutheast  @USCGLANTAREA",
