      "text": "#USCG remains steadfast in our mission to secure U.S. maritime approaches.\n\nOver the past several days, crews from USCGC Robert Ward, MSST LA/LB 91103, and Station Los Angeles/Long Beach successfully interdicted 21 illegal aliens attempting to enter the country by sea.\n\nContinuing our longstanding immigration enforcement mission, the Coast Guard continues to surge assets to interdict unlawful maritime migration and uphold the rule of law.\n#maritimesecurity  #alieninterdiction\n@USCGPACAREA @DHSgov",
