      "text": "An important day in Coast Guard history! 108 years ago today, Congress passed legislation assigning the port security role to the Coast Guard. Every day, Coast Guard members are hard at work to control, secure, and defend our borders and maritime approaches. Always on watch across America’s ports and waterways, we are deterring and interdicting criminal actors, and preventing the trafficking of drugs, weapons, and people. @FBI @DHSgov #USCG #WWII",
